      "content": "i guess. it's just that everything feels so heavy... and i feel like i'm just an anchor dragging everyone else down. if i wasn't around, everything would just be lighter. like, it wouldn't even be a tragedy for anyone, just a quiet thing that happened. it would be so peaceful to just not have to carry it anymore.",
